      "content": "We are excited to share Orbit Software v2.4, which now features a new dark mode, enhanced search filters for the user directory, and resolved crashes when users upload PNG files larger than 5MB. While the online status of the database stabilization process remains pending, our developers are actively tuning the startup speed and refining our crash resolution logic to ensure a smoother future experience. Please note that the 'Delete Account' button functionality is currently being optimized to completely address the reported gap in the user journey.",
